==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*jьgrati}}. Cognate to {{cog|sh|ȉgrati}} and {{cog|cs|hrát}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|игра́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-играть.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|игра́ть|impf|pf=сыгра́ть,поигра́ть|vn=игре́ц<q:nomen agentis>,игру́н<q:nomen agentis>,игру́нка<q:nomen agentis>}}

# {{lb|ru|intransitive}} to [[play]]
# to [[play]] {{+obj|ru|:в(acc)<a sport or game>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' в [[футбо́л]]|to play football}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' в [[видеои́гры]]|to play video games}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' в [[ка́рты]]|to play cards}}
# to [[play]] {{+obj|ru|:на(pre)<a musical instrument>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' на [[гита́ре]]|to play the guitar}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' на [[пиани́но]]|to play the piano}}
# to [[take advantage of]] {{+obj|ru|:на(pre)<someone's emotions, feelings, etc.>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' на [[инсти́нктах]]|to play on someone's instincts}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' на [[эмо́циях]]|to play on someone's emotions}}
# to [[play]], to [[perform]] {{+obj|ru|acc<a song, a composer, etc.>}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' Шу́берта|to play Schubert}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' [[со́ло]]|to perform a solo}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' [[пе́сню]]|to play a song}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' [[ва́льс]]|to play a waltz}}
# to [[act]], to [[play]] {{+obj|ru|acc<a role, a character in a film or play, etc.>}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' [[ро́ль]]|to play a role}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' [[Ю́лия]] Це́заря|to play Julius Caesar}}
# to [[deal with]] (something) in a [[careless]], [[irresponsible]] or [[contemptuous]] [[way]] {{+obj|ru|ins/:с(ins)<something>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' [[жи́знями]] [[люде́й]]|to play with people's lives}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''игра́ть''' c [[огнём]]|to play with fire}}
# to [[play]], to [[pretend]] to [[be]] or [[do]] {{q|often as a children's game}} {{+obj|ru|:в(acc)<something>}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' в [[ковбо́ев]]|to play cowboys}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' в [[пека́рню]]|to play bakery}}
# to [[play]] for a team, or as a character or faction in a game {{+obj|ru|:за(acc)}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' за [[Спарта́к]]|to play for Spartak}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''игра́ть''' за [[Марио]]|to play as Mario}}
# {{lb|ru|intransitive|figuratively}} to [[flit]], [[flicker]] or [[shimmer]] {{+obj|ru|:на(pre)/:в(pre)<on/in something>}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[со́лнце]] '''игра́ло''' на [[пове́рхности]] [[воды́]]|the Sun played on the surface of the water}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[улы́бка]] '''игра́ла''' на его [[лице́]]|a smile flitted across his face}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[бриллиа́нт]] [[чуде́сно]] '''игра́л''' на [[свету́]]|the diamond shimmered wonderfully in the light}}

